{-
   The command line on JavaScript, which there is not one of.

   `process.argv` is deliberately not wrapped here, on the terms Design-Test.md §11.2's F4 note
   gives: the JavaScript target gets the runner and not the harness, and orchestration happens in a
   native parent that spawns `node`. A half-`Environment` on this target would be the lie that note
   is written against, and the selection a JavaScript run needs is the one the parent already made
   when it decided which script to hand over.
-}

pub fn runnerArguments() -> [String] = []

pub fn ownProgram() -> Maybe(String) = Nothing
